<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>Verify Your Email Address</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #08090C;
      color: #E2E8F0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }
    table {
      border-collapse: separate;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #08090C;
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }
    .outer-container {
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #0E1218;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }
    .header {
      padding: 24px 32px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #131822 0%, #0E1218 100%);
    }
    .brand-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .brand-accent {
      color: #5EC8FF;
    }
    .logo-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      background-color: rgba(94, 200, 255, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(94, 200, 255, 0.25);
      border-radius: 9999px;
      color: #5EC8FF;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 32px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 14px 0;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    p {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #94A3B8;
    }
    .btn-container {
      margin: 28px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 32px;
      background-color: #5EC8FF;
      color: #0B0D10 !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(94, 200, 255, 0.35);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    }
    .info-card {
      background-color: #090C11;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      margin: 18px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #94A3B8;
    }
    .raw-link-box {
      margin-top: 22px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      background-color: #090C11;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
      border-radius: 8px;
      word-break: break-all;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #64748B;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .raw-link-box a {
      color: #5EC8FF;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .footer {
      padding: 24px 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      background-color: #090B0F;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #64748B;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="outer-container">
      <div class="header">
        <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
          <tr>
            <td align="left" valign="middle">
              <span class="brand-title">ZYRON<span class="brand-accent">.</span></span>
            </td>
            <td align="right" valign="middle">
              <div class="logo-badge">ZYRON // PROTOCOL_SECURITY</div>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Verify Your Account Email</h1>
        <p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
        <p>Thank you for registering on Zyron. To activate your account and access your protocol audit workspace, please verify your email address using the button below:</p>

        <div class="btn-container">
          <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" class="btn" target="_blank">Verify Email Address &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
          This verification link expires in <strong>24 hours</strong> and can only be used once. Once verified, your workspace credentials will be activated for automated AST scanning and auditor triage.
        </div>

        <div class="raw-link-box">
          Button not working? Copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br>
          <a href="{{verificationUrl}}">{{verificationUrl}}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <div>ZYRON SECURITY PROTOCOL &bull; AUTONOMOUS SMART CONTRACT AUDIT</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 6px;">&copy; {{currentYear}} Zyron Protocol Security. All rights reserved.</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 4px; font-size: 10px;">If you did not create an account on Zyron, you can safely ignore this email.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
